# --- Payments (personal non-commercial test mode) ---
# Fail-closed kill switch. Payments are ENABLED only when this is the literal
# lowercase string "true" (no trimming, no case folding); missing, empty or any
# other value — including "TRUE", "True", " true " — means DISABLED.
#
# While disabled the bot refuses to create invoice links and rejects every
# pre_checkout_query, so no charge can be initiated. A successful_payment that
# still arrives IS forwarded for idempotent fulfillment — an already-charged
# user must never be left undelivered — and is logged without identifiers.
PAYMENTS_ENABLED=
